@startuml

skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Consumer System\n(Client)" as Client
participant "TMF 915 API\n(Model Management Block)" as API
participant "DeploymentScheduler" as Scheduler
participant "MlflowModelService\n(Container Orchestrator)" as Backend
database "Model Repository\n(MLflow / S3)" as Repo

== 1. Client to API (TMF 915 Layer) ==
Client -> API: POST /aiModel\n(target: AiModelSpecification, state: "reserved")
activate API

== 2. Internal Payload Isolation ==
API -> API: Parse & Validate\nIsolate TMF 638 Service metadata

== 3. API to Scheduler Integration ==
API -> Scheduler: Offload deployment task\n(Asynchronous Handoff)
activate Scheduler

API --> Client: HTTP 201 / 202 Created\n(Immediate response to avoid blocking)
deactivate API

== 4. Scheduler to Container Orchestrator ==
Scheduler -> Backend: Instruct infrastructure to deploy
activate Backend

Backend -> Repo: Resolve Model Artifacts
activate Repo
Repo --> Backend: Return exact model hash / binaries
deactivate Repo

Backend -> Backend: Verify compute constraints\nCheck Docker image boundaries
Backend -> Backend: Spin up containerized prediction endpoints

Backend --> Scheduler: State change: ACTIVE\n(Attach hostPort, dockerHost, etc.)
deactivate Backend
deactivate Scheduler

@enduml